      { q: "Approximately how many Mexicans died during the decade of revolutionary conflict?", choices: ["Only about 100 people", "Roughly one million, out of a population of about 15 million", "Nearly the entire population of Mexico", "No deaths occurred during the Revolution"], answer: 1, explain: "Historians estimate roughly one million deaths during the Revolution." }
